<title>NETHERLANDS: Gucci Q1 net revs by product line.</title>
<headline>Gucci Q1 net revs by product line.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter to April 30.</p>
<p>(in millions of U.S. dollars).</p>
<p>    Leather goods			     158.85 vs 111.85</p>
<p>    Shoes					  45.74 vs  35.11</p>
<p>    Ready-to-wear				17.04 vs  17.47</p>
<p>    Ties and Scarves			    8.38 vs  11.22</p>
<p>    Other products			     13.07 vs   9.32</p>
<p>    Royalties				    11.25 vs   8.49</p>
<p>    Total					 254.32 vs 193.45</p>
<p>Note - Gucci is listed on the Amsterdam and New York Stock exchanges. -- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
